  "description": "The BOGAN ST2 is designed in collaboration with riders from the bikepacking community. Featuring a unique Tange champion frame in a Silver / Grey colourway, with a radical geometry for stability and long ride comfort. Made with real world travellers in mind, the BOGAN ST2 has soft tape Dirt Drop handlebars, a padded WTB saddle, 2x Drivetrain compatibility and a massive clearance for up to 29x2 tyres to enable you to go the distance. Water bottle mounts inside the frame triangle maximize space for a bag and a multitude of attachment points allow for easy fitting of any rack on the market. This bike is in it for the long ride.\"",
